<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA, UKRAINE PLAN PARALLEL ELECTRICITY LINK.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA, UKRAINE PLAN PARALLEL ELECTRICITY LINK.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria and Ukraine plan to set up a parallel link of their power systems, Ukraine's Energy and Electrification Minister Yuri Bochkaryov said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Bochkaryov, winding up his three-day visit to Bulgaria, said Bulgarian experts would visit Ukraine next week to discuss technical details.</p>
<p>But experts said such a link would not be build up soon. Bulgaria's power grid is in parallel with its Balkan neighbours Serbia, Greece and Turkey, they added.</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, 359-2-84561</p>
</text>
